[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Gaffer is installed in %%PREFIX%%/lib/gaffer and is started with the
`gaffer` command.

This package does not include the Arnold, RenderMan, 3Delight and Cycles
renderer integrations, nor GafferML.

Gaffer uses USD's Python bindings (the `pxr` module) to provide parameter
metadata for USD shaders and lights, and to select by USD kind in the
Viewer. graphics/openusd does not install them by default, in which case
these features are not available.
EOM
}
]
